<div style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:1.2;padding-top:10px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;">
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Receiving Quick Payments</strong></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Please check that your bank details are correct to ensure you receive prompt payment for this job under </span><a href="https://www.idal.co/user/profile" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="My Details"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">My Details</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">. To receive your payment as quickly as possible, log in and mark the job as completed the following day after the job is done. If you should forget to mark it as completed, it auto completes after 3 days. You can see all your automated invoices </span><a href="https://www.idal.co/payments" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="here"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">here</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">You will receive the total payment for the job minus iDAL's 10% commission. Clients have 30 days (60 days in rare cases) to settle the payment after the job is done. Payment will be released as soon as the client has paid after completing the job; IDAL uses a third-party payment system and does not hold any monies payable to models for jobs.</span></p>
</div>
