<!--[if mso]><table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding-right: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif"><![endif]-->
<div style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:1.2;padding-top:10px;padding-right:10px;padding-bottom:10px;padding-left:10px;">
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;"><strong>Contacting a Client</strong></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">The client’s contact name and number will be visible 24 hours before your job starts in </span><a href="https://www.idal.co/jobs" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="Job Details"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Job Details</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">. Please only contact them directly for directions, dietary requirements, if you are running late or similar. If you need to cancel because of illness or report anything else that requires assistance, please email </span><a href="mailto:support@idal.co" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="support@idal.co"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">support@idal.co</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">. The client is able to reach you by messaging you directly through the platform where you can respond; for your safety we don't provide them with your contact details.</span></p>
</div>
