<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; mso-line-height-alt: NaNpx;"></p>
<p style="margin: 0; direction: ltr; color: #000000; line-height: 1.2; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-alt: 17px;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">For any other questions, please check our </span><a href="https://www.idal.co/faq" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="Frequently Asked Questions"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">Frequently Asked Questions</span></a><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">. If you can't find your answer, we are always happy to help. Write to us at </span><a href="mailto:support@idal.co" style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;" target="_blank" title="support@idal.co"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 14px;">support@idal.co</span></a></p>
